    },
    {
      "section": null,
      "cue": "Start the hollandaise",
      "text": "Add {mustard}, a pinch of salt, a pinch of white pepper, the juice of {lemon} and the yolks of {eggs}. TM7: 30 sec / 60 °C / speed 3, butterfly.",
